    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ferries are funny things. We take them for granted, but strange things can and do happen. Play as a ferryman, issuing tickets and transporting vehicles (and maybe more) between the shores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to treat the VIPs well and report and suspicious vehicles. Check the board for news, wanted criminals to look out for, or weather reports. But stay on schedule or you'll be looking for a new job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most importantly, don't let those long nights get the better of you. Be vigilent because darkness is when the unexpected happens.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ferries are funny things. We take them for granted, but strange things can and do happen. Play as a ferryman, issuing tickets and transporting vehicles (and maybe more) between the shores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to treat the VIPs well and report and suspicious vehicles. Check the board for news, wanted criminals to look out for, or weather reports. But stay on schedule or you'll be looking for a new job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most importantly, don't let those long nights get the better of you. Be vigilent because darkness is when the unexpected happens.</p>",
    "short_description": "A ferryman. An old but trustworthy cable ferry. A peaceful night job. What could possibly go wrong?",
